<title>POLAND: Polish ship engines maker issues PLN 10 mln CPS.</title>
<headline>Polish ship engines maker issues PLN 10 mln CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish ship engine maker  H. Cegielski Poznan SA issued 10 million zlotys of commercial paper on Thursday, issue manager ING Bank NV in Warsaw said in a statement.</p>
<p>The commercial papers, called KWIT, were sold for a two-month period with a yield of 18.8 percent.</p>
<p>The tranche is part of the firm's 30 million zloty KWIT scheme wich began in April 1996.</p>
<p>--Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
